<.shell title="Navigation" current={:navigation}>
  <h1>Navigation</h1>
  <p class="lead">How people move between and within pages.</p>

  <h2>Top bar</h2>
  <p>
    Navy, with the amber rule and logo. It holds the main sections and the account menu. The
    current section is underlined in amber.
  </p>
  <div class="demo" style="padding: 0">
    <div class="app-bar">
      <a href="#" class="brand">SAR <span>Duty</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main">
        <a href="#" aria-current="page">Activities</a>
        <a href="#">Members</a>
        <a href="#">Qualifications</a>
        <a href="#">Groups</a>
        <a href="#">Tax credit letters</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="account" aria-haspopup="menu">
        Squamish SAR <.svg_icon name="chevron-down" size={16} />
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>On a phone</h3>
  <p>
    Below 1024px the sections, Admin, and the account menu move behind a Menu button. The
    panel opens under the amber rule, the width of the screen, with the current section
    marked in amber. Going to another page closes it.
  </p>
  <div class="demo phone-bar" style="padding: 0">
    <div class="app-bar">
      <a href="#" class="brand">SAR <span>Duty</span></a>
      <button class="account" aria-expanded="true">
        <.svg_icon name="x-mark" size={24} /> Menu
      </button>
    </div>
    <nav class="phone-menu" aria-label="Main">
      <a href="#">Dashboard</a>
      <a href="#" aria-current="page">Activities</a>
      <a href="#">Members</a>
      <a href="#">Qualifications</a>
      <a href="#">Groups</a>
      <a href="#">Tax credit letters</a>
      <hr />
      <div class="note">avery@example.com</div>
      <a href="#">Settings</a>
      <hr />
      <a href="#">Log out</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <h2>Menu</h2>
  <p>A short list under a button, such as the account menu.</p>
  <div class="demo">
    <ul class="menu" role="menu" style="max-width: 240px">
      <li class="muted caption">avery@example.com</li>
      <li role="none"><a href="#" role="menuitem">Settings</a></li>
      <li role="none"><a href="#" role="menuitem">Team settings</a></li>
      <li role="none"><hr /></li>
      <li role="none"><a href="#" role="menuitem">Log out</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <p class="spec">
    Keep menus for a few links that do not fit in the bar. Actions on a page are buttons.
  </p>

  <h2>Breadcrumbs</h2>
  <div class="demo">
    <ol class="breadcrumbs">
      <li><a href="#">Squamish SAR</a></li>
      <li><.svg_icon name="chevron-right" size={16} /><a href="#">Members</a></li>
      <li aria-current="page"><.svg_icon name="chevron-right" size={16} />Avery Chen</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <p class="spec">
    On every page below a section's list. The last item is the current page and is not a link.
  </p>

  <h2>Back link</h2>
  <div class="demo">
    <a href="#" class="back-link"><.svg_icon name="chevron-left" size={16} />Settings</a>
  </div>
  <p class="spec">
    For pages outside the main tree, like a settings form, instead of breadcrumbs.
  </p>

  <h2>Tabs</h2>
  <div class="demo">
    <nav class="tabs" aria-label="Member">
      <a href="#" aria-current="page">Attendance</a>
      <a href="#">Qualifications</a>
      <a href="#">Groups</a>
      <a href="#">ID card</a>
    </nav>
    <p>Each tab is its own page with its own URL, so links and the back button work.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="spec">
    In the app: <code>&lt;.tabs label="Member"&gt;</code>
    with a <code>&lt;:tab navigate=&#123;…&#125; current&gt;</code>
    for each page. <code>current</code>
    marks the page you are on.
  </p>

  <h2>Pagination</h2>
  <div class="demo">
    <div class="table-summary">
      <span>Showing 51 to 100 of 1,912 activities</span>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Pages">
      <ul class="pagination">
        <li><a href="#"><.svg_icon name="chevron-left" size={16} />Previous</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">1</a></li>
        <li><span aria-current="page">2</span></li>
        <li><a href="#">3</a></li>
        <li><span class="muted">…</span></li>
        <li><a href="#">39</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">Next<.svg_icon name="chevron-right" size={16} /></a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <p class="spec">
    Under long tables. Prefer filters that shrink the list over paging through it.
  </p>
</.shell>
